                          Transfer Protocol setup
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Transfer protocols used with LogicBBS are mainly XPR library protocols,
Allthough the hydra transfer protocol are internal.

The preferences file for the transfer protocols are located in your
{bbsmainpath}SYSTEM/PROTOCOLS


You have 10 protocols available for setup.


Example setup for a Zmodem transfer protocol.
>--------------------------------------------
NAME%1		Zmodem			;Name shown to user

PROTOCOL%1	xprzmodem.library	;Library name

AUTOZMODEM%1				;Auto-activator for Zmodem
					;Not used by other protocols


OPTIONS%1				;Options for Zmodem
					;normally not needed,
					;all options needed, are pre-selected.
-----------------------------------------------<


example setup for internal Hydra protocol
>----------------------------------------
NAME%2		Hydra protocol
PROTOCOL%2	HYDRA
OPTIONS%2	none
----------------------------------------<
